---

---

<section
  class="relative left-1/2 right-1/2 mx-[-50vw] w-screen bg-(--panel) py-14 md:py-20"
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-left">
      What makes us different
    </h2>
    <p
      class="text-(--text-dim) text-left text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl mb-4"
    >
      We aren't just another tech platform. We're a local community resource
      built on trust.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 items-stretch mt-16">
    <!-- <-- 3 cards with icons and text -->
    <div
      class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-left shadow-2xl rounded-lg px-8 py-8 bg-(--panel-head)"
    >
      <div
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--primary)]/15"
      >
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="var(--primary)"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="h-6 w-6"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path
            d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.35 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.6-.01C8.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"
          ></path>
          <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-(--text) text-left mt-0 mb-0">
        Manual Vetting
      </h3>
      <p class="text-(--text-dim) text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl mt-0 mb-0">
        Algorithms don't decide who gets listed. Real humans review licenses,
        insurance, and past client feedback before approving any premium
        listing.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-left shadow-2xl rounded-lg px-8 py-8 bg-(--panel-head)"
    >
      <div
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--primary)]/15"
      >
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="var(--primary)"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="h-6 w-6"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path>
          <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
          <path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path>
          <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-(--text) text-left mt-0 mb-0">
        Community First
      </h3>
      <p class="text-(--text-dim) text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl mt-0 mb-0">
        We prioritize independent, locally-owned businesses over massive
        national franchises, keeping money flowing within the Edmonton economy.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col items-start gap-3 text-left shadow-2xl rounded-lg px-8 py-8 bg-(--panel-head)"
    >
      <div
        class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[var(--primary)]/15"
      >
        <svg
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="var(--primary)"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="h-6 w-6"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path>
          <polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-(--text) text-left mt-0 mb-0">
        Free for Homeowners
      </h3>
      <p class="text-(--text-dim) text-base sm:text-lg md:text-xl mt-0 mb-0">
        You shouldn't have to create an account or give away your data just to
        find a plumber. Browsing and contacting pros is always 100% free.
      </p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
